cal"><div data-rid="9404a50f-332b-427e-a9e6-e3a99cc858ca" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Ramr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-wtzigs"><div data-rid="0be4b8cf-3df4-48df-ace7-fa3568400b64" class="r-eb0pgj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Explain Micro Plastics Free?</p></span></div><div data-rid="6bed18eb-1fff-4e94-ab2b-8d7bea8322b6" class="r-ip4hje"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-a9didk" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Ramr2:" aria-controls="replo-:Ramr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="fa690572-80d1-4ea7-b10e-198960f81732" class="r-1xr6wc5"><div data-rid="aa48efde-52a5-4188-8ec4-c7b9a01fa822" class="r-kudhdh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We also submit samples from every farm to be tested for microplastics. Concentration of microplastics in all measured size ranges were below the Limit of Quantitation (LOQ), which is 0.0094 particles per gram. This essentially means that no microplastics were detected in Seatopia samples tested.  In simpler terms, this is a good result suggesting that it is free from measurable microplastics, according to the sensitivity of the test performed. This should provide some reassurance about the quality and safety of the Seatopia products in relation to microplastic contamination. Enjoy your meal knowing that this specific concern has been thoroughly checked!</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="05cbf7ed-c156-42d4-8b41-ddfd82989a3b" class="r-rpbcp5" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="4481d2bf-cb16-46a9-8879-28fbc7497037" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Remr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-inoei0"><div data-rid="414b7b55-6bfd-4d01-9523-5881c068738f" class="r-jiblhs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is my seafood delivered fresh or frozen?</p></span></div><div data-rid="daf633be-362a-45c7-89e2-8d74d531c0af" class="r-1bukkje"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-15xuwep" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div id="replo-:Remr2:" aria-controls="replo-:Remr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="37093dcf-92db-4add-98ff-63d508c2c18b" class="r-1djc4ut"><div data-rid="69292047-4803-4f10-9f50-819b3ed704f3" class="r-avu11n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Your seafood will be super-frozen with liquid nitrogen at peak freshness to lock in its flavor, nutrients and texture until you're ready to enjoy it. Unlike seafood at the grocery store that can be sitting out for unknown lengths of time or thawed on arrival - gradually degrading in quality and flavor until it’s purchased.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a6612a59-a1a6-46ce-a6ab-aa0f5def400c" class="r-shibyb" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="75d766ff-6268-4725-a726-165bef7891e6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rimr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1r8tz"><div data-rid="38aaafd2-fae1-474a-b2a6-9b6a43ad84af" class="r-cqi4mf alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Do I have to be home for delivery?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="8a260c77-9801-47a8-87cc-84e64527af7c" class="r-f6ymzy"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-f9mp2e" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rimr2:" aria-controls="replo-:Rimr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="2d4ba6c5-b95d-4587-a110-7f149188b21b" class="r-p5bb8g"><div data-rid="69cba03a-ef93-419b-b993-de6cbea7e9a0" class="r-1bt11u0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Your fish arrives frozen in an eco-friendly, insulated box with the perfect amount of dry ice to keep your seafood frozen until the end of your scheduled delivery day.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="96aca045-f5f5-494f-b861-98d7166a52f2" class="r-15qizky" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3e7bbe24-d1b5-46ba-be0d-c4c6a74ab0c3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rmmr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-a07fa3"><div data-rid="7b55823b-87a8-4f8e-9996-cdda94a3bf19" class="r-1bsycw9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is included in my Seatopia membership?</p></span></div><div data-rid="21332209-464f-46d3-87d6-109f9bfe264d" class="r-1wdgjb9"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-c48613" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rmmr2:" aria-controls="replo-:Rmmr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="6fb1d7e2-b24f-4122-b7ad-61339b12ef7c" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" tabindex="-1" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-w554p"><div data-rid="7c24a9c4-1b2c-4f8e-876d-be007c7b7727" class="r-824xff alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>A Seatopia membership is like a Community Supported Seafood box, bridging the gap between you and sustainable aquafarms. This model allows our farmers to plan their harvests more effectively, promoting a focus on quality and ecosystem health. In line with the Slow Food Movement, we're stepping away from impersonal, commodity-based supply chains. Subscriptions are flexible—you get preferred pricing, and can adjust or cancel anytime. This isn't just about buying seafood; it's a pact for a sustainable, transparent food system.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b3c9ca3a-a5ea-4100-b46d-2a355eba7981" class="r-75vwcn" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="d4473bc8-3774-4e3e-9b88-d8fe23d39406" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rqmr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-16l1wv2"><div data-rid="64f28b0c-66fd-4ba3-8299-e1577c43e64d" class="r-14te5jy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Why choose farmed seafood instead of wild-caught?</p></span></div><div data-rid="0755c8b8-464f-44d8-b968-98b1aaa524e3" class="r-h311j6"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1k980jl" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rqmr2:" aria-controls="replo-:Rqmr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="b0ec1357-9e0a-465e-be92-92f7b3756da8" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" tabindex="-1" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-9l66iv"><div data-rid="87acc5a4-0290-452c-b3ea-ba255ff7d9eb" class="r-jpeaw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Cleaner Profile</strong><br>Thanks to our stringent farming practices, specific species selection, and certified clean feed, our farm-raised seafood contains lower levels of mercury, PCBs, and microplastics compared to many wild-caught alternatives.</p></span></div><div data-rid="19aa5a5d-8962-46e0-bde7-401f6cefa4f2" class="r-16f73bx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Nutrient-Rich</strong><br>Our seafood is higher in essential nutrients and omega-3 fatty acids. This is because we control the diets of our fish to optimize their health benefits, ensuring they are fed a balanced diet rich in the nutrients that matter most.</p></span></div><div data-rid="79dfae00-8cd0-4a0e-b96f-3eac4a9ae250" class="r-17v1apk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Natural Coloring</strong><br>Just like wild-caught fish, the vibrant colors of our farm-raised seafood come from a diet high in antioxidant-rich micro-algae, specifically astaxanthin. This means you're getting a product that's not only beautiful but also natural.</p></span></div><div data-rid="fc15c571-3fd1-4a59-ba7f-3750252c8d7d" class="r-141pwnn alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>No Antibiotics or Hormones<br></strong>We're committed to raising our seafood without the use of antibiotics or hormones. This aligns with our ethos of providing you with the cleanest, most natural products possible.</p></span></div><div data-rid="0b727c9a-0e96-4953-a68a-fbe82f57858b" class="r-1agwmi9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Sustainability & Scalability</strong><br>Our approach to aquaculture is not only sustainable but also scalable. This ensures that we can continue to provide high-quality seafood while having a minimal impact on marine ecosystems.</p></span></div><div data-rid="0534e6c9-cd9f-45ae-9937-c136a2efb8ff" class="r-4mlsp2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>So when you choose Seatopia's farm-raised seafood, you're opting for a product that's superior in quality, nutritional value, and environmental impact. Learn more.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="e27840d7-2506-4df3-8928-f9c049a33958" class="r-1ss58x2"><style>

